  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bangladesh RRNRP (Objective 1) - Contribution to WFP for Emergency Food Aid to Rohingya Refugees</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide Emergency Food support to Rohingya Refugees in Bangladesh. This Bilateral ODA and an earmarked spend through multilaterals. The project is ODA eligible as the programme is providing essential food support to Refugees in Bangladesh which is within the DAC List of ODA recipient countries. The support is provided through UN World Food Programme (WFP) which is within the DAC list of ODA eligible organization.</narrative>
  </description>
